    seed_jit_spawned_thread_never_runs_join_segv_2026-11-09, 0, "2026-11-09 filed from the #8003 HTTP lane: under the Rust seed JIT a spawned thread never runs its body and the subsequent join segfaults. Needs a minimal spawn+join repro spec and root cause in the seed JIT thread entry/trampoline."
    seed_jit_spawned_thread_never_runs_join_segv_2026-11-09, 1, "2026-11-09 bootp2: root cause native_callable (runtime/src/executor.rs) read a seed-JIT HeapObjectType::Closure header word as the entry; fixed via registry-validated func_ptr dispatch, PR #8082 (RED STATUS_ACCESS_VIOLATION -> GREEN 19 isolated_thread tests incl 64-thread stress). Audit: C twin runtime_thread.c spl_worker_callable assumes [0]=fn_ptr and does not handle RtCoreClosure (kind-first) objects; not changed."

